data: {"id": "c614923441104179-thinking-parallel_evidence-1579", "run_id": "c614923441104179", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已对 `aiops-case-v17/workload` 完成首轮事实采集。\n\n### 已采集事实\n1.  **实体身份与拓扑**：Pod `workload` (UID: `85aece07-6ffa-41db-9e5a-f351771a8864`) 运行在 `node2`，IP 为 `172.16.104.36`。\n2.  **当前生命周期**：K8s 资源对象状态为 `Running`，但事件日志显示存在大量的 `Back-off restarting failed container` 警告（累计 342 次，跨度 86 分钟），表明 Pod 处于频繁重启循环中。\n3.  **Crash 根因线索**：\n    *   **退出代码 137 (SIGKILL)**：`kubectl describe` 明确显示容器退出码为 137，这通常是操作系统 OOM Killer 杀死了容器进程，或者容器收到了硬终止信号。\n    *   **探针超时**：事件显示 `Liveness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.36:18080/healt", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789396491197, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

